# Python (tools/)

Follow [LSB Development Guide — Python](https://github.com/LandSandBoat/server/wiki/Development-Guide). Python 3, `lower_snake_case`. Format with Black; lint with Pylint (`tools/requirements.txt`).

- Run tools from `tools/`. DB settings come from `settings/network.lua`.
- `dbtool.py`: backup / update / migrate. Do not run destructive DB commands unless asked.
- Character-data migrations live in `tools/migrations/`.
- Do not commit `tools/config.yaml` or `sql/backups/`.
- Do not edit `dev.docker-compose.yml`; copy to `docker-compose.yml` if local Docker changes are needed.
